    <string name="wizard_title_vehicle">Vehicle</string>
    <string name="wizard_desc_vehicle">Setup looks up your vehicle\'s MPG for cost estimates using EPA\'s fueleconomy.gov service. It fetches the vehicle list when setup opens and sends your year, make, model and selected vehicle ID as you choose; no account or install ID is sent. The Google MPG search sends your entered year, make and model to Google in your browser.</string>
