    <string name="wizard_gas_price_auto_update_title">Update gas price daily</string>
    <string name="wizard_gas_price_auto_update_desc">Off until you turn it on. Fetches your fuel type\'s regional average daily. Android\'s geocoder may send your last coordinates to its provider; EIA receives a regional fuel-price request, without an account or install ID. This can run outside a dash. Turn this off and save setup to stop automatic refreshes.</string>
